height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 4-2. DeviceNet의 메세징 프로토콜(관련 예제 실험)</span> </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 5-1. DeviceNet의 통신 객체 클래스</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">4</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"463\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 5-2. DeviceNet의 통신 객체 클래스</span> </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 6. Network Access State Machine(관련 예제 실험)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">5</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"463\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 7-1. 선정의 마스터 슬레이브 연결 집합</span> </p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">Chapter 7-2. 선정의 마스터 슬레이브 연결 집합(관련 예제 실험)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">6</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"463\" height=\"35\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">응용 프로그램 및 개발 장치 설계 기법 </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<br><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp; <br><!--StartFragment--></font><p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">10. 교재 : DeviceNet 기초 및 응용 (저자 : 김동성, ODVA) 제공 </p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">11. 신청서 제출처 : [Email] <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><a href=\"mailto:darkmacia81@kumoh.ac.kr\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">darkmacia81</span>@kumoh.ac.kr</font></u><